  m_description: Few mages within the Realm of the Living possess the strength to
    fulfill the promise hidden within their souls. He is one of them. He thinks his
    goal still lies beyond the horizon, but I can feel its shadow already reaching
    for him.
  m_specialCharacter: 1
  m_firstInteract: 1
  m_doomedKnightComment: 1
  m_secondInteract: 1
  m_doomedKnightRemarks: Few mages can fulfill the promise within their souls. He
    is one. Though he believes his destiny lies ahead, I already feel it drawing
    near.
  m_necroRemarks: The book he possesses is insignificant compared to me. Its wisdom
    is but a fraction of the knowledge I carry within. He is still too young to understand
    the mysteries of the realms.
  m_characterType: 1
  m_armyData: {fileID: 0}
  m_projectName: Sir X
